Package: freqresp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3,
         python3-numpy,
         python3-alsaaudio
Recommends: python3-matplotlib
Description: Audio loopback frequency response measurement tool
 Measures audio loopback frequency response from 20 Hz to 20 kHz by
 playing stepped sine tones through the DAC output and recording from
 the ADC input simultaneously.
 .
 Produces a text table and optional PNG plot of the frequency response.
 Useful for verifying HiFiBerry DAC/ADC boards and diagnosing signal
 chain issues.
